 "build": {
  "id": "9c09cde8-a9e3-46cd-8e18-72bb319cba20",
  "title": "Headhunter PvP build",
  "description": "[overview]\nA lot of what’s built into this talent set up is maxing uptime on guts spilled and berserker axe. Cycling your energy maintenance abilities will allow full uptime in unbridled rage while spamming berserker axe’s. This allows for born in blood to always be 2 stacked on you and healing for a lot per tick with brutal form. \n\nHow I tend to open combat\nWarband\nOn use/racial\nGut spiller\n3 zerkers \nMaimed spear\n3 zerkers\nThrow weapon(sometimes depending on the class I will use berserker rush and spam headbutt before I get there)\nSlow spear \n\nRinse repeat",
